msgid "HELP_TASKS"
msgstr ""
"You need to do tasks.\n"
"Some tasks require to come close to the subject of testing (812, partly "
"938).\n"
"Some tasks require to bring Class-D (080, 162, 173, 522, 939, partly "
"938).\n"
"Some tasks require to bring object/item to special place (347, 914).\n"
"Some tasks require to come with special item (791).\n"
"Some tasks require to interact or use subject of testing (023, 067, 249).\n"
"Some tasks require to interact with item while having another item in "
"inventory (5270-2306)"

msgid "HELP_EVENTS"
msgstr ""
"Also the game has events.\n"
"There are only two event implemented right now - SCP-023 critical state "
"and SCP-2845 event.\n"
"For SCP-023 - if you round took long (> 2 minutes), you need to go to "
"Maintenance Zone\n"
"and go to SCP-023, replacing his \"eyes\" as soon, as possible.\n"
"For SCP-2845 event, you'll need patience - this SCP spawns is ~9% chance "
"(3/32).\n"
"If they spawned, go to SCP-812 to open and close the door.\n"
"Wait 90 seconds, you'll achieve secret ending!"

